Feedback — licensing summary
============================

Feedback is licensed in two halves, deliberately, and they are not the same.

  CODE    GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.
          Full text in COPYING. This covers everything under src/main/java,
          src/generated, and the build scripts.

  ASSETS  All Rights Reserved.
          Every original texture, model, sound and translation under
          src/main/resources/assets — see LICENSE-ASSETS.

GPL rather than LGPL on purpose. Anything built on this code is free too.
That is the point, not a side effect.

Why the split, and what it obliges, is written up in LICENSING.md. What this
project owes to other mods, and what may be taken from each, is in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md. Who owns it is in AUTHORS.
